{"id": "126628", "name": "מקדמים קבועים הומוגנית – בעיית התחלה של ay″ + by = 0 (א)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>פתרו את המשוואה הדיפרנציאלית הבאה </span></p>\n<p> \\[{{CT:0}} y'' + {{CT:1}} y = 0\\]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>עם תנאי ההתחלה </span></p>\n<p>\\[y(0) = {{CT:2}},\\ y^\\prime(0) = {{CT:3}}\\]</p>\n<p><br />\\[y(x)\\] = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>To solve the differential equation \\[{{CT:0}} \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} + {{CT:1}} y = 0\\] Let \\(y = e^{mx}\\) and hence \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=me^{mx}\\) and \\(\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = m^2e^{mx}\\) <br />Substituting for \\(y\\) gives \\[{{CT:0}}m^2e^{mx} + {{CT:1}}e^{mx} = 0\\] and dividing throughout by \\(e^{mx}\\) and {{CT:4}} gives \\[m^2 + {{CT:5}} = 0\\] which can be solved to give {{CT:6}} <br />For roots of \\(m\\) in the form \\(a±bi\\), the solution to the differential equation is of the form \\[y = {{CT:7}}(Acos(bx)+Bsin(bx))\\] and therefore \\[y= Acos({{CT:8}})+Bsin({{CT:8}})\\] Given \\(\\ y(0) = {{CT:2}}\\) \\[ A = {{CT:2}}\\] and \\(\\ y^\\prime(0) = {{CT:3}}\\) \\[B = {{CT:9}}\\] Therefore \\[y = {{CT:10}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "sa1:ev(subst(y=ans1,ode),simp);\n sa2:ev(sa1,nouns);\n sa3:fullratsimp(expand(sa2));\n sa4:ev(ans1,x=0);\n sa5:block([ds],ds:diff(ans1,x),ev(ds,x=0));\n sa6:block(listconstvars:true,listofvars(ans1));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "sa3", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.34, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution satisfies the ODE.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution does not satisfy the ODE.</p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "sa4", "tans": "n4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.33, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution satisfies the initial condition \\(y(0) = {{CT:2}}\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution does not satisfy the initial condition \\(y(0) = {{CT:2}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "sa5", "tans": "n6", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.33, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-T ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution satisfies the initial condition \\(y^{\\prime}(0) = {{CT:3}}\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-F ", "feedback": "<p>Your solution does not satisfy the initial condition \\(y^{\\prime}(0) = {{CT:3}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEqu